<title>LEBANON: Lebanon hangs Egyptian killer.</title>
<headline>Lebanon hangs Egyptian killer.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>An Eygptian man was executed by hanging in Lebanon on Wednesday for killing a Lebanese man and his wife in 1992, judicial sources said.</p>
<p>They said Hassan Atieh, 41, was hanged before dawn at Roumyeh jail north of Beirut after he was sentenced to death on March 11 for killing and throwing in a well a man and his wife with the aim of robbery.</p>
<p>Atieh was the 12th person executed in Lebanon since the end of the 1975-90 civil war. The others were two Syrians, one Palestinian, and eight Lebanese.</p>
</text>
